    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d606-a1">

                <pb facs="1017" n="970" xml:id="pg970"/>


                <head>Draft Agreed Announcement<anchor n="2" xml:id="d606-f1"/></head>
                <pb facs="d606-5" n="5" type="facsimile" xml:id="d606-5"/>
                <p rendition="#center">AGREED ANNOUNCEMENT OF THE AMBASSADORS OF THE UNITED STATES
                    OF AMERICA AND THE PEOPLE’S REPUBLIC OF CHINA</p>
                <p>Ambassador U. Alexis Johnson, on behalf of the Government of the United States of
                    America, and Ambassador Wang Ping-nan, on behalf of the Government of the
                    People’s Republic of China, agree, without prejudice to the views of either side
                    with respect to the merits of any of their disputes, [or, alternatively, “to the
                    inherent rights of either party”] to announce:</p>
                <p>The United States of America and the People’s Republic of China are determined
                    that they should settle disputes between their two countries in the Taiwan area
                    or elsewhere by peaceful means only, and are determined they will not resort to
                    the threat or use of force;</p>
                <p>The two Ambassadors should continue their talks to settle the practical matters
                    at issue between them and should expeditiously seek such additional practical
                    and feasible means for the realization of the common determination expressed
                    above, [including the holding of negotiations at a higher level]<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d606-f2"/> as may be ascertained to be appropriate and
                    necessary.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
